---
# Writing TOML with toml++ combines the bits of its format_flags, which the
# static analyzer reports from inside toml++'s headers, where no NOLINT can
# reach. Only the code in this directory leaves that check out; it stays on
# for the rest of scrap, and returns when the TOML writer here is replaced.

InheritParentConfig: true

Checks: >
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange

WarningsAsErrors: '*'
